#: xfburn-x.desktop.in:22
msgid "Burn Image (Xfburn-X)"
msgstr "Zapiši odtis (Xfburn-X)"

#: io.github.asdfjkl.xfburn-x.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"CD, DVD, and Blu-ray burning tool with verification and diagnostic logging"
msgstr "Orodje za zapisovanje CD, DVD in Blu-ray s preverjanjem in diagnostičnim beleženjem"

#: io.github.asdfjkl.xfburn-x.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Dominik Klein"
msgstr "Dominik Klein"

#: io.github.asdfjkl.xfburn-x.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Xfburn-X is an enhanced fork of Xfburn based on the libburnia libraries, "
"designed to install side-by-side with upstream Xfburn without conflicts. It "
"can blank rewritable discs, burn and create ISO images, create audio CDs, "
"and burn data compositions to CD, DVD, or Blu-ray (including M-DISC), with "
"built-in post-burn per-sector hash verification and a user-mode diagnostic "
"flight-recorder logger."
msgstr "Xfburn-X je izboljšana izpeljanka programa Xfburn, zasnovana na knjižnicah libburnia in namenjena vzporedni namestitvi z izvirnim programom Xfburn brez sporov. Omogoča brisanje prepisovalnih diskov, zapisovanje in ustvarjanje odtisov ISO, ustvarjanje zvočnih CD-jev ter zapisovanje podatkovnih kompozicij na CD, DVD ali Blu-ray (vključno z M-DISC), z vgrajenim preverjanjem zgoščenih vrednosti po sektorjih po zapisu in uporabniškim diagnostičnim dnevnikom delovanja."

#: io.github.asdfjkl.xfburn-x.metainfo.xml.in:37
msgid ""
"Initial Xfburn-X release forked from Xfburn with post-burn verification, GDK/"
"udev threading deadlock fixes, and user-mode diagnostic logging."
msgstr "Prva izdaja Xfburn-X, izpeljana iz programa Xfburn, s preverjanjem po zapisu, popravki zastojev niti GDK/udev in uporabniškim diagnostičnim beleženjem."

